{"unit_id":"FeatherHunter__dsh-plugin-ui-debug#card-zh","repo":"FeatherHunter/dsh-plugin-ui-debug","commit":"334b251b8e3d54883155b66b395a45a258847c17","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"DSH Plugin UI Debug 是面向 DSH Web 插件开发与测试的界面调试工具。它向 DSH 注册 ui_shot、ui_drive 两个工具，并自动注册调试 skill；工具通过 Chrome DevTools Protocol 驱动本机 Chrome 或 Edge。你可以截取网页、导航、点击、输入、滚动、拖拽、分步截图并读取页面 JavaScript 表达式结果。适合需要检查布局、交互和 DOM 状态的插件开发者。运行需要 Node.js 22+ 与 Chrome 或 Edge，不需要 API 密钥。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/index.ts:242-253","src/index.ts:256-369","src/cdp.ts:144-155"]}
